    "Scan of the 1954 edition of the Kirkwood, Missouri, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1933; aerial photographs from 1990; field checked in 1954; photo revised in 1993; last revised in 1993; printed in 1993.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.82 x 27.34 inches. Printed projection: Transverse Mercator; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
